. *###########################################################################
. *## R6 EXPORT-START SAMPLE (copy exactly into later R6 files)
. *## = R2's start years (rule A), comparison group, usable-row rule, doubtful
. *##   energy records, year window (R2-02's rule) and markers, from block-r2
